                                </h2>
                            </header>
                        
                        <div class="container ce-textpic rich-text__body">
                            <div class="block-flow ce-bodytext">
                                
                                <p>The tool allows the user to calculate levelised cost of hydrogen and to adjust key system parameters, including electricity costs, discount rate, lifetime, specific energy consumption, full load hours. It illustrates the shares of major cost components and provides sensitivities.</p>
<p>The tool accompanies the publication “Levelised cost of hydrogen: Making the application of the LCOH concept more consistent and more useful”.</p>
                            </div>
